      "html" : "<\/div><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-183249\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-183249\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm; 1 pound per square foot (psf) = 0.0479 kPa, 1 pound per square inch = 0.00689 MPa.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-183250\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-183250\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDR = design required; o.c. = on center.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-183251\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-183251\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta.&#160;&#160;&#160;Steel framing shall be minimum 33 ksi steel for 33 mil and 43 mil steel and 50 ksi steel for 54 mil steel or thicker.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-183252\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-183252\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tb.&#160;&#160;&#160;Screws shall comply with the requirements of AISI S240.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-183253\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-183253\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tc.&#160;&#160;&#160;Foam sheathing shall have a minimum compressive strength of 15 pounds per square inch in accordance with ASTM C 578 or ASTM C 1289.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "19107-html-3",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "For SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm; 1 pound per square foot (psf) = 0.0479 kPa, 1 pound per square inch = 0.00689 MPa.\n\n DR = design required; o.c. = on center.\n\n a. Steel framing shall be minimum 33 ksi steel for 33 mil and 43 mil steel and 50 ksi steel for 54 mil steel or thicker.\n\n b. Screws shall comply with the requirements of AISI S240.\n\n c. Foam sheathing shall have a minimum compressive strength of 15 pounds per square inch in accordance with ASTM C 578 or ASTM C 1289."
    }
